"en-GB\",\"description\":\"Guy Harris brings a quirky Attenborough-style voice to Lumote: The Mastermote Chronicles – a glowing underwater puzzle game with personality and pulse.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2021-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Lumote Mastermote Chronicles – Attenborough Voice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Guy Harris brings the world of bioluminescent Motes to life with a warm, nature-style narration in this indie game adventure.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Lighting up the Bioverse with voice</h2>  \r\n<p>Lumote: The Mastermote Chronicles is a vibrant underwater puzzle platformer that needed a quirky yet grounded narration. The producers wanted a style that felt like a nature documentary with a hint of fun – and who better to deliver that than a <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice\">David Attenborough voiceover</a>?</p>  \r\n<p>Using that iconic narration style, I guided players through Lumote’s surreal neon world with curiosity, wonder, and just a touch of cheeky charm. Think glowing squishy sea blobs meets Sir David in the deep.</p>\r\n"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_7o94Czmg8Q","title":"Lumote Mastermote Chronicles – Attenborough Voice","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/lumote-mastermote-chronicles-voiceover.jpg","alt":"lumote-mastermote-chronicles-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>What is Lumote all about?</h2>  \r\n<p>This indie gem, developed by Luminawesome Games and published by Wired Productions, takes you deep into the Great Depths – a trippy world of squishy creatures called Motes. You play as Lumote, an inquisitive little blob who sets out to restore balance when his glowing habitat is overtaken by the mysterious Mastermote.</p>  \r\n<p>As Lumote, you possess other creatures, solve bio-electric puzzles, and bounce your way through beautifully immersive levels powered by an electronic soundtrack. Learn more on the <a href=\"/https://store.steampowered.com/app/791240/Lumote_The_Mastermote_Chronicles/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Steam Page for Lumote\">Steam page for Lumote</a>.</p>\r\n"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section ","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Want more voiceovers like this?</h2>  \r\n<p>If you like this kind of thing, you might enjoy another <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/horizon-zero-dawn-voice\" title=\"Horizon Zero Dawn Voiceover\">Attenborough-style voiceover I did for Horizon Zero Dawn</a> – also rich with drama and world-building.</p>  \r\n<p>Whether it’s epic AAA trailers or quirky indie titles, I can deliver the right voice for your game. I’ve worked on many <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceovers\">game trailers</a> and know how to bring that cinematic weight or comedic tone to life.</p>\r\n"}}],null]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Let’s bring your world to life</h2>  \r\n<p>Need a game narrator or voiceover with personality? I offer natural, warm, characterful reads, often with same-day turnaround from my pro-level studio. Drop me a line on the <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">Contact Guy</a> page with your script or idea, and I’ll happily send over a sample read. Let’s make your project shine.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Lumote Mastermote Chronicles – Attenborough Voice","pageUrl":"lumote-mastermote-chronicles-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","492",{"href":"/vegetarian-society","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/vegetarian-society.jpg","alt":"Vegetarian society Videos","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Vegetarian society videos"}]]}],["$","$L3","709",{"href":"/bank-sohar-explainer-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/bank-sohar-explainer-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Bank Sohar Explainer Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Bank Sohar Explainer Voiceover"}]]}],["$","$L3","916",{"href":"/hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover.jpg","alt":"hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"classNa